#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "No interface found for the index."
msgstr "Интерфейс по индексу не найден."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"B<if_nametoindex>()  and B<if_indextoname>()  may also fail for any of the "
"errors specified for B<socket>(2)  or B<ioctl>(2)."
msgstr ""
"Также функции B<if_nametoindex>() и B<if_indextoname>() могут завершиться с "
"ошибками, перечисленными в B<socket>(2) или B<ioctl>(2)."

